// httpd/hpack — HPACK header compression (RFC 7541) for the HTTP/2 layer.
//
// The decoder is complete: indexed and literal fields, the dynamic table with
// size accounting and eviction, size-update instructions, and Huffman-coded
// strings. The encoder is deliberately stateless — indexed fields for exact
// static-table matches, plain literals for everything else, no dynamic
// insertions and no Huffman on output. Stateless output cannot desynchronise,
// which is the stability this package promises; the cost is some bytes on the
// wire. Both tables below are generated from the python-hyper hpack library
// rather than hand-typed, and pinned by the RFC's own test vectors.

// -------------------------------------------------------------- static table

val _staticTable = [
  [":authority", ""],
  [":method", "GET"],
  [":method", "POST"],
  [":path", "/"],
  [":path", "/index.html"],
  [":scheme", "http"],
