// -------------------------------------------------------------- huffman code

// The HPACK Huffman code (RFC 7541 Appendix B): code word and bit length per
// symbol 0..255, then EOS. Generated from the python-hyper hpack tables, not
// hand-typed, and pinned by the RFC test vectors in tests/httpd.sfl.
val _huffCodes = [
